# Operator-local environment file. Contains the database password.
env.sh

# Rendered .tpl outputs. These contain plaintext secrets and per-deploy values
# after envsubst, so the .tpl is committed and the result never is.
#
# Listed one by one rather than as a glob, deliberately: adding a template is
# then a two-line change and you cannot forget the second one silently. A glob
# was tried and was wrong - `**/*.yaml` also matches kustomization.yaml, which
# MUST be committed. Copied from trinity-magure-deploy.
00-foundation/namespace.yaml
00-foundation/secrets.yaml
07-routes/ingress-nginx.yaml
07-routes/ingress-alb.yaml
10-argocd/argocd-server-ingress.yaml
